{{!--
  Cast button on the line of a staff spell.
  With only one way to cast (a cantrip, or no spontaneous slots of this rank or higher)
  it is that cast button from staff-cast-buttons.hbs. With two ways (full charge cost,
  or 1 charge + a spell slot) it opens the card's drawer, where both options are shown.
  A popup to choose between them may replace the drawer later.

  Parameters (hash):
    spell    Formatted staff spell (formatSpell() plus the staff charge fields)
    rank     Rank of the staff rank group the spell is listed under
    staffId  Id of the staff item
--}}
{{#if (or spell.isCantrip (not spell.hasSpontaneousOption))}}
{{> "modules/pf2e-mobile-compact/templates/parts/spells/staff-cast-buttons.hbs" spell=spell rank=rank staffId=staffId}}
{{else}}
<button type="button" class="touch-target btn-cast m-inline-flex m-align-center m-justify-center" data-action="toggleActionSummary" data-item-id="{{spell.cardKey}}" title="Choose how to cast {{spell.name}}: staff charges, or 1 charge + a spell slot">
  <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i>&nbsp; / &nbsp;<i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
</button>
{{/if}}
